  "headline": "Advocates report nearly 50 construction-worker arrests in Danville ICE operations",
  "bounded_summary": "The Philadelphia Inquirer reported that immigration advocates said at least 49 construction workers were arrested in two operations near a Geisinger Medical Center construction project, including eight arrests on September 8 and 41 on September 2. Geisinger confirmed law-enforcement activity connected to the project on September 2; ICE and DHS did not provide comment by publication time, so the arrest count remains explicitly attributed to advocates.",
